@startuml STM-7
!include _style.iuml
title STM-7 (System level) — Lifecycle of an EInvoice\ne_invoices.status, invoice_adjustments.status · v1.0 · 01/11/2026

state c1 <<choice>>
[*] --> requested : / send invoice data\nto provider
note left of requested
  created when a top-up is credited
  (EInvoice) or a refund is done
  (InvoiceAdjustment)
end note
requested --> issued : provider returns invoice number\n/ send invoice to Driver
requested --> c1 : provider error or no reply\n/ attempts + 1, record error kind
c1 --> failed : [transient error\nand attempts < 4]
c1 --> needs_review : [else]\n/ notify Admin with the error
failed --> requested : after(retry delay)\n/ send again
needs_review --> requested : Admin retries\n/ rebuild invoice data,\ncounter not reset
issued --> [*]
note right of issued
  An invoice failure never blocks
  charging. Retry delays: 5 min, 30 min, 2 h.
end note
@enduml
